{"id": "EUVD-2026-98942", "enisaUuid": "11f8a9f3-cca5-3329-8768-ecd884111fd5", "description": "JetLinks Community through 2.10.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows users with only query access on transparent-codec to overwrite product codecs via POST /device/transparent-codec/{productId}. Because the endpoint lacks @SaveAction, attackers can save arbitrary codec providers and configurations, controlling how transparent messages are decoded and encoded for every device of that product.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:10", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T17:20:57", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/jetlinks-community-transparent-codec-save-authz-bypass", "https://github.com/jetlinks/jetlinks-community/blob/60ecc9f65d96acfd38da8daecdb0062fc72034f3/jetlinks-manager/device-manager/src/main/java/org/jetlinks/community/device/web/TransparentMessageCodecController.java#L138-L143", "https://github.com/hs-web/hsweb-framework/blob/5.0.1/hsweb-authorization/hsweb-authorization-api/src/main/java/org/hswebframework/web/authorization/Authentication.java#L206-L218", "https://github.com/jetlinks/jetlinks-community", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jetlinks-community-through-2.10.0-missing-authorization-via-product-level-transparent-codec-save"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6q8r-vgvx-r98p", "CVE-2026-110109"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "495a8aa8-1d1b-3114-b32b-76934894c2a5", "product": {"name": "JetLinks Community", "vendor": {"name": "jetlinks"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.10.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "293de045-efc2-3712-9981-3180e9daf696", "vendor": {"name": "jetlinks"}}], "isExploited": false}